    "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>With the general availability of </span><span>the</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>topn</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>extension</span><span>&nbsp;in Azure Database for PostgreSQL</span><span>, you can quickly compute the most </span><span>frequently</span><span>&nbsp;occurring values in datasets, </span><span>making it </span><span>perfect for large data analysis and </span><span>real</span><span>-</span><span>time dashboards.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span><span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/postgresql/extensions/concepts-extensions-versions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><br></div>",
    "Markdown": "With the general availability of the topn extension in Azure Database for PostgreSQL , you can quickly compute the most frequently occurring values in datasets, making it perfect for large data analysis and real - time dashboards.\n\nLearn more ."
